{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":607659,\"title\":\"Kotsos at the EEC\",\"tagline\":\"\",\"overview\":\"Kotsos, the representative Greek, is sent to Brussels to meet Mrs. Evropaidou and take part in the 1st EEC Conference. He meets representatives from other member countries, who follow him to Greece to teach him European customs through fast-paced, simple, and understandable lessons. First of all, \\\"Honor and Ethics,\\\" taught by the German advisor. \\\"Reform of Public Life,\\\" taught by the French advisor, \\\"Marital Jealousy,\\\" taught by the Dutch advisor, etc. Kotsos, like a good student, tries to change his mindset and adapt to the new circumstances, and then does his best to satisfy the nine beautiful representatives of the European states who come to Greece to assess his progress. They party with him and leave him physically exhausted, but award him the gold medal for his excellent \\\"performance.\\\"\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/p3r297wttBukMlS3aAo5G1vH9Ed.jpg\",\"backdrop\":null,\"rating\":4.2,\"voteCount\":6,\"year\":1980,\"runtime\":0,\"genres\":[\"Comedy\"],\"status\":\"Released\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"countries\":[{\"code\":\"GR\",\"name\":\"Greece\"}],\"budget\":0,\"revenue\":0,\"director\":\"Dimis Dadiras\",\"cast\":[{\"id\":1072001,\"name\":\"Dimis Dadiras\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/oQluFxccYhHFBS647DK67cM6wCu.jpg\"},{\"id\":147799,\"name\":\"Kostas Voutsas\",\"character\":\"Kotsos\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/tLxH1G3BO6jAurQtHR4RDZCbmC7.jpg\"},{\"id\":1592642,\"name\":\"Eleni Erimou\",\"character\":\"Journalist\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/b3lK68DwmnEd2Amr9pNMF96glnw.jpg\"},{\"id\":1260725,\"name\":\"Giannis Vogiatzis\",\"character\":\"Dutch Councillor\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/nEIbt2UD4CW3Z9AHx7NtEzGOhqb.jpg\"},{\"id\":1117912,\"name\":\"Stathis Psaltis\",\"character\":\"Clerk\",\"photo\":\"https://image.