this seemingly perfect world.\",\"genres\":[\"Horror\",\"Comedy\",\"Fantasy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1153576,\"title\":\"Street Fighter\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ccxdepKqORLwccbzvO4eAGkN0IC.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/zDE9hd1SG9695YncbZGjSf7Z9Jk.jpg\",\"rating\":6.2,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"In 1993, estranged Street Fighters Ryu and Ken Masters are thrown back into combat when the mysterious Chun-Li recruits them for the next World Warrior Tournament: a brutal clash of fists, fate, and fury. But behind this battle royale lies a deadly conspiracy that forces them to face off against each other and the demons of their past. And if they don't, it's GAME OVER!\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Comedy\",\"Fantasy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1084244,\"title\":\"Toy Story 5\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/sfQtVlIHljToOwYjhe21KPGzZWK.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/qjTqY5coNiz6sVtPng40IzltsoN.jpg\",\"rating\":8.2,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"When Bonnie receives a Lilypad tablet as a gift and becomes obsessed, Buzz, Woody, Jessie and the rest of the gang's jobs become exponentially harder when they have to go head to head with the all-new threat to playtime.\",\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Family\",\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1465063,\"title\":\"Forgotten Island\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/myd1K3gefdNAWFsGNRDdMeiK9Qg.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/2o9FzuBzCqrDTdlHRuEVnGD2d5h.jpg\",\"rating\":8,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"While celebrating their last night together, high school graduates and best friends Jo and Raissa stumble upon a mysterious portal that transports them to the fantastical island of Nakali. When they discover that the memories of their entire friendship are the price for returning home, Jo and Raissa must race to find a way to leave the island before they forget each other forever.\",\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Adventure\",\"Fantasy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1204680,\"title\":\"Coyote vs. Acme\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/kYDCl2y0VPvhT5eYWbMRInPoB03.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/rueyXwlewVPAP5NkqCUJx4RjhqB.jpg\",\"rating\":8.2,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"After Acme products fail him one too many times in his dogged pursuit of the Roadrunner, Wile E. Coyote decides to hire a billboard lawyer to sue the Acme Corporation.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Adventure\",\"Family\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1108427,\"title\":\"Moana\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/gaet1xQ2nxrG0V1Ep9T20ZMNEIC.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/c6BPbkO5Npt1OdwttAxCFo06wtH.jpg\",\"rating\":7.4,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Teenage Moana answers the Ocean's call and, for the first time, voyages beyond the reef of her island of Motunui with infamous demigod Maui on an unforgettable journey to restore prosperity to her people.\",\"genres\":[\"Family\",\"Fantasy\",\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":891621,\"title\":\"Wild Horse Nine\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/dNJFRtVg3xLQ7dbNIQ55cmmIniD.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/3uLA0ujne91bkzFStZICCYeqhnt.jpg\",\"rating\":7.9,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Shortly before the 1973 Chilean coup, CIA agents Chris and Lee are dispatched from Santiago to Easter Island by their bureau chief, MJ. Amongst the Island's iconic statues, and as the longtime partners wrestle with their dark pasts and present conspiracies, Chris's newfound bond with a pair of rebellious students threatens to send everyone’s trip to this remote paradise sideways.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Crime\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1148365,\"title\":\"Matchbox the Movie\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/aHhHRz6nOpwkqJs5ASeRGAdK2dt.